[550.841733, "o", "urrent version. Please update. Support for old versions may be purcha\u001b[29;60Hsed (at exorbitant rates) by contacting i@izs.me\u001b[K\u001b[1m\u001b[30;60Hnpm\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[33mwarn\u001b[39m \u001b[94mdeprecated\u001b[39m are-we-there-yet@1.1.5: This package is no longer supported.\u001b[K\u001b[1m\u001b[31;60Hnpm\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[33mwarn\u001b[39m \u001b[94mdeprecated\u001b[39m gauge@2.7.4: This package is no longer supported.\u001b[K\u001b[1m\u001b[32;60Hnpm\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[33mwarn\u001b[39m \u001b[94mdeprecated\u001b[39m q@1.1.2: You or someone you depend on is using Q, the JavaScript Promise library that gave Jav\u001b[33;60HaScript developers strong feelings about promises. They can almost certainly migrate to the native JavaScript prom\u001b[34;60Hise now. Thank you literally everyone for joining me in this bet against the odds. Be excellent to each other.\u001b[K\u001b[1m\u001b[35;60Hnpm\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[33mwarn\u001b[39m \u001b[94mdeprecated\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[1m\u001b[36;60Hnpm\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[33mwarn\u001b[39m \u001b[94mdeprecated\u001b[39m (For a CapTP with native promises, see @endo/eventual-send and @endo/captp)\u001b[K\u001b[1m\u001b[37;60Hnpm\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[33mwarn\u001b[39m \u001b[94mdeprecated\u001b[39m glob@4.2.2: Old "]
[550.841747, "o", "versions of glob are not supported, and contain widely publicized security vul\u001b[38;60Hnerabilities, which have been fixed in the current version. Please update. Support for old versions may be purchas\u001b[39;60Hed (at exorbitant rates) by contacting i@izs.me\u001b[K\u001b[1m\u001b[40;60Hnpm\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[33mwarn\u001b[39m \u001b[94mdeprecated\u001b[39m inflight@1.0.4: This module is not supported, and leaks memory. Do not use it. Check out lru-c\u001b[41;60Hache if you want a good and tested way to coalesce async requests by a key value, which is much more comprehensive\u001b[42;60H and powerful.\u001b[K\u001b[1m\u001b[43;60Hnpm\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[33mwarn\u001b[39m \u001b[94mdeprecated\u001b[39m node-uuid@1.4.7: Use uuid module instead\u001b[K\u001b[1m\u001b[44;60Hnpm\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[33mwarn\u001b[39m \u001b[94mdeprecated\u001b[39m minimatch@0.2.14: Please update to minimatch 3.0.2 or higher to avoid a RegExp DoS issue\u001b[K\u001b[1m\u001b[45;60Hnpm\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[33mwarn\u001b[39m \u001b[94mdeprecated\u001b[39m graceful-fs@3.0.8: please upgrade to graceful-fs 4 for compatibility with current and future v\u001b[46;60Hersions of Node.js\u001b[K\u001b[1m\u001b[47;60Hnpm\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[33mwarn\u001b[39m"]
